o exhibits substantial alignment with evidence-based practices per the notes but suffers a setback due to the mischaracterization of Tacrolimus.\n   [RESULT] A\n\nOverall, while both responses show competence across multiple criteria, Response A edges out as more consistent and aligned with the guidelines provided in the notes. [RESULT] A", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1732915453, "model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_7f6be3efb0", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 410, "prompt_tokens": 5572, "total_tokens": 5982, "completion_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 5376}}}


